        "content": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"fr\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n<title>La friction hydro-alcoolique Comment ?</title>\n<style>\n    * {\n        box-sizing: border-box;\n    }\n    body {\n        font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;\n        margin: 0 auto;\n        padding: 30px 40px;\n        max-width: 1050px;\n        color: #1a1a1a;\n        background-color: #ffffff;\n    }\n    \n    /* Headers */\n    h1 {\n        margin: 0;\n        font-size: 4.2rem;\n        letter-spacing: -1.5px;\n        font-weight: 900;\n        line-height: 1;\n        color: #211e1e;\n    }\n    h2 {\n        margin: 5px 0 20px 0;\n        font-size: 4rem;\n        letter-spacing: -1.5px;\n        font-weight: 900;\n        line-height: 1.1;\n        color: #eb6625;\n    }\n    \n    /* Intro */\n    .intro-text {\n        font-size: 1.45rem;\n        font-weight: bold;\n        color: #eb6625;\n        line-height: 1.3;\n        margin-bottom: 25px;\n    }\n    .duration {\n        display: flex;\n        align-items: center;\n        font-size: 1.6rem;\n        font-weight: bold;\n        margin-bottom: 35px;\n    }\n    .duration .duration-highlight {\n        color: #eb6625;\n        margin-left: 8px;\n    }\n\n    /* Grid Layout */\n    .grid-container {\n        display: grid;\n        grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);\n        column-gap: 30px;\n        row-gap: 40px;\n        margin-bottom: 50px;\n    }\n    .grid-item-double {\n        grid-column: span 2;\n    }\n    .image-group {\n        display: flex;\n        gap: 30px;\n        margin-bottom: 15px;\n    }\n    .image-container {\n        position: relative;\n        flex: 1;\n        margin-bottom: 15px;\n    }\n    .image-group .image-container {\n        margin-bottom: 0;\n    }\n    \n    /* Placeholders & Badges */\n    .placeholder {\n        width: 100%;\n        height: 220px;\n        background-color: #f3f3f3;\n        display: flex;\n        align-items: center;\n        justify-content: center;\n        color: #777;\n        font-style: italic;\n        font-size: 1rem;\n        text-align: center;\n        padding: 10px;\n    }\n    .number-badge {\n        position: absolute;\n        top: 0;\n        left: 0;\n        background-color: #eb6625;\n        color: white;\n        font-weight: bold;\n        font-size: 1.8rem;\n        padding: 3px 10px;\n        z-index: 10;\n    }\n    .instruction-text {\n        font-size: 1.1rem;\n        line-height: 1.35;\n    }\n\n    /* Orange Footer Banner */\n    .footer-banner {\n        background-color: #eb6625;\n        color: white;\n        display: flex;\n        padding: 25px 30px;\n        margin-top: 30px;\n        align-items: center;\n    }\n    .footer-section {\n        flex: 1;\n        display: flex;\n        align-items: center;\n        padding: 0 20px;\n    }\n    .footer-section:first-child {\n        padding-left: 0;\n        flex: 1.2;\n    }\n    .footer-section:last-child {\n        padding-right: 0;\n        flex: 0.9;\n    }\n    .footer-divider {\n        width: 1px;\n        height: 60px;\n        background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.5);\n    }\n    \n    .who-text {\n        font-size: 1.4rem;\n        font-weight: bold;\n        line-height: 1.1;\n    }\n    .safety-text h3 {\n        margin: 0 0 8px 0;\n        font-size: 1.6rem;\n        font-weight: bold;\n    }\n    .safety-text p {\n        margin: 0;\n        font-size: 0.85rem;\n    }\n    .save-lives-text h3 {\n        margin: 0 0 5px 0;\n        font-size: 1.9rem;\n        font-weight: 900;\n        letter-spacing: 0.5px;\n    }\n    .save-lives-text p {\n        margin: 0;\n        font-size: 1.4rem;\n    }\n\n    /* Legal Footer */\n    .legal-footer {\n        background-color: #b3b3b3;\n        color: white;\n        text-align: center;\n        padding: 15px 30px;\n        font-size: 0.65rem;\n        line-height: 1.5;\n        margin-bottom: 8px;\n    }\n    .legal-footer p {\n        margin: 0;\n    }\n    .revision {\n        text-align: center;\n        color: #b3b3b3;\n        font-size: 0.8rem;\n        margin-top: 5px;\n    }\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n\n    <!-- Header -->\n    <h1>La friction hydro-alcoolique</h1>\n    <h2>Comment ?</h2>\n    \n    <div class=\"intro-text\">\n        Utiliser la friction hydro-alcoolique pour l'hygiène des mains !<br>\n        Laver vos mains au savon et à l'eau lorsqu'elles sont visiblement souillées.\n    </div>\n    \n    <div class=\"duration\">\n        <div class=\"placeholder\" style=\"width: 34px; height: 34px; border-radius: 50%; margin-right: 15px; background-color: #eb6625; color: white; border: none; padding: 0; font-size: 0.5rem;\" title=\"Timer Icon\">\n            <svg width=\"34\" height=\"34\" viewBox=\"0 0 32 32\">\n              <circle cx=\"16\" cy=\"16\" r=\"16\" fill=\"#eb6625\"/>\n              <circle cx=\"16\" cy=\"16\" r=\"13\" fill=\"transparent\" stroke=\"white\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/>\n              <path d=\"M 16 16 L 16 3 A 13 13 0 0 1 27 24 Z\" fill=\"white\"/>\n            </svg>\n        </div>\n        Durée de la procédure : <span class=\"duration-highlight\">20-30 secondes</span>\n    </div>\n\n    <!-- Instructions Grid -->\n    <div class=\"grid-container\">\n        \n        <!-- Row 1: Items 1a & 1b -->\n        <div class=\"grid-item-double\">\n            <div class=\"image-group\">\n                <div class=\"image-container\">\n                    <div class=\"number-badge\">1a</div>\n                    <div class=\"placeholder\">[Illustration: Verser le produit hydro-alcoolique dans la paume]</div>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"image-container\">\n                    <div class=\"number-badge\">1b</div>\n                    <div class=\"placeholder\">[Illustration: Produit dans le creux de la paume]</div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"instruction-text\">\n                Remplir la paume d'une main avec le produit hydro-alcoolique, recouvrir toutes les surfaces des mains et frictionner :\n            </div>\n        </div>\n        \n        <!-- Row 1: Item 2 -->\n        <div>\n            <div class=\"image-container\">\n                <div class=\"number-badge\">2</div>\n                <div class=\"placeholder\">[Illustration: Friction paume contre paume]</div>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"instruction-text\">\n                Paume contre paume par mouvement de rotation ;\n            </div>\n        </div>\n\n        <!-- Row 2: Item 3 -->\n        <div>\n            <div class=\"image-container\">\n                <div class=\"number-badge\">3</div>\n                <div class=\"placeholder\">[Illustration: Friction du dos de la main]</div>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"instruction-text\">\n                Le dos de la main gauche avec un mouvement d'avant en arrière exercé par la paume de la main droite, et vice versa ;\n            </div>\n        </div>\n\n        <!-- Row 2: Item 4 -->\n        <div>\n            <div class=\"image-container\">\n                <div class=\"number-badge\">4</div>\n                <div class=\"placeholder\">[Illustration: Doigts entrelacés]</div>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"instruction-text\">\n                Les espaces interdigitaux, paume contre paume et doigts entrelacés, en exerçant un mouvement d'avant en arrière ;\n            </div>\n        </div>\n\n        <!-- Row 2: Item 5 -->\n        <div>\n            <div class=\"image-container\">\n                <div class=\"number-badge\">5</div>\n                <div class=\"placeholder\">[Illustration: Dos des doigts dans la paume opposée]</div>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"instruction-text\">\n                Le dos des doigts dans la paume de la main opposée, avec un mouvement d'aller-retour latéral ;\n            </div>\n        </div>\n\n        <!-- Row 3: Item 6 -->\n        <div>\n            <div class=\"image-container\">\n                <div class=\"number-badge\">6</div>\n                <div class=\"placeholder\">[Illustration: Friction du pouce]</div>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"instruction-text\">\n                Le pouce de la main gauche par rotation dans la main droite, et vice versa ;\n            </div>\n        </div>\n\n        <!-- Row 3: Item 7 -->\n        <div>\n            <div class=\"image-container\">\n                <div class=\"number-badge\">7</div>\n                <div class=\"placeholder\">[Illustration: Friction de la pulpe des doigts]</div>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"instruction-text\">\n                La pulpe des doigts de la main droite dans la paume de la main gauche, et vice et versa ;\n            </div>\n        </div>\n\n        <!-- Row 3: Item 8 -->\n        <div>\n            <div class=\"image-container\">\n                <div class=\"number-badge\">8</div>\n                <div class=\"placeholder\">[Illustration: Mains propres et sèches]</div>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"instruction-text\">\n                Une fois sèches, vos mains sont prêtes pour le soin.\n            </div>\n        </div>\n\n    </div>\n\n    <!-- Orange Footer Banner -->\n    <div class=\"footer-banner\">\n        <div class=\"footer-section\">\n            <div class=\"placeholder\" style=\"width: 70px; height: 70px; border-radius: 50%; border: 2px solid white; background: transparent; color: white; font-size: 0.8rem; margin-right: 15px; padding: 0;\">[Logo OMS]</div>\n            <div class=\"who-text\">\n                Organisation<br>mondiale de la Santé\n            </div>\n        </div>\n        \n        <div class=\"footer-divider\"></div>\n        \n        <div class=\"footer-section\">\n            <div class=\"safety-text\">\n                <h3>Sécurité des patients</h3>\n                <p>Une Alliance mondiale pour des soins plus sûrs</p>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n        \n        <div class=\"footer-divider\"></div>\n        \n        <div class=\"footer-section\">\n            <div class=\"save-lives-text\">\n                <h3>SAVE LIVES</h3>\n                <p>Clean <b>Your</b> Hands</p>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n    \n    <!-- Legal & Revision -->\n    <div class=\"legal-footer\">\n        <p>L'Organisation Mondiale de la Santé (OMS) a pris toutes les dispositions nécessaires pour vérifier les informations contenues dans ce document. Toutefois, le document publié est diffusé sans aucune garantie, expresse ou implicite.</p>\n        <p>La responsabilité de l'interprétation et de l'utilisation de ce document incombe au lecteur. En aucun cas, l'OMS ne saurait être tenue responsable des préjudices subis du fait de son utilisation.</p>\n        <p>L'OMS remercie les Hôpitaux Universitaires de Genève (HUG), en particulier les collaborateurs du Service de Prévention et Contrôle de l'Infection, pour leur participation active à l'élaboration de ce matériel.</p>\n    </div>\n    \n    <div class=\"revision\">\n        Révision : Mai 2009\n    </div>\n\n</body>\n</html>"
